{"title":"Career roadmap · Data Analyst","role":"Data Analyst","summary":"A Data Analyst collects, cleans, analyses and interprets data to help organisations make better decisions. Economics is a strong foundation because it develops statistics, quantitative reasoning, research methods, economic modelling and evidence-based decision-making.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Economics"},"about":[{"label":"Career-route check","text":"Strong alignment with an additional technical-skill layer. The economics degree provides analytical foundations; employability depends heavily on practical data skills and a project portfolio."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"However, a BA Economics graduate should deliberately add SQL, Excel, Python/R, statistics, data visualisation and business analytics to become job-ready for modern Data Analyst roles."}]},{"heading":"Typical route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BA Economics","Data Analytics Internship","Data Analyst Intern/Junior Data Analyst","Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Lead","Analytics Manager / Data Analytics Consultant"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build statistics, SQL, Excel, Python/R and data-visualisation skills alongside economics."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in business, financial, economic, marketing, product or policy analytics."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress into Senior Data Analyst, Analytics Lead, BI Lead or Data Analytics Consultant roles."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into analytics leadership, data strategy, consulting or specialised economic/data research."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Statistics + Excel fundamentals"},{"text":"Economics/statistics courses"},{"text":"3 analytical spreadsheets"},{"text":"Quantitative skills"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Excel advanced + basic data visualisation"},{"text":"Practical projects"},{"text":"Interactive dashboard"},{"text":"Data handling"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"PostgreSQL Documentation, practice datasets","url":"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/"},{"text":"50+ SQL queries"},{"text":"Database skills"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Python/R for analytics"},{"text":"Python/pandas courses"},{"text":"3 Python/R projects"},{"text":"Programming"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Power BI/Tableau + internship"},{"text":"BI projects"},{"text":"Dashboard + internship"},{"text":"Employability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"End-to-end analytics"},{"text":"Real datasets"},{"text":"5-project portfolio"},{"text":"Job readiness"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced analytics/econometrics"},{"text":"Dissertation + applied projects"},{"text":"Economic/data research project"},{"text":"Specialisation"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Interview + professional portfolio"},{"text":"Case studies"},{"text":"CV + GitHub + dashboard portfolio"},{"text":"Placement readiness"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects to prioritise"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microeconomics"},{"text":"Macroeconomics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Mathematics for Economics"},{"text":"Quantitative Methods"},{"text":"Research Methodology"},{"text":"Financial Economics"},{"text":"Development Economics"},{"text":"International Economics"},{"text":"Public Economics"},{"text":"Computer Applications/Data Analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Must-have"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},